Subject: [PATCH 1468/3799] soh: rename func_80A3E090 -> EnGm_UpdatePositions

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: derives the collider, talk and focus positions by transforming three fixed forward offsets by the actor's rotation, so all three sit out in front of him.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Gm/z_en_gm.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Gm/z_en_gm.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Gm/z_en_gm.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Gm/z_en_gm.c
index 9734ee591..8d2224e1b 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Gm/z_en_gm.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Gm/z_en_gm.c
@@ -305,7 +305,8 @@ void EnGm_Update(Actor* thisx, PlayState* play) {
     this->updateFunc(this, play);
 }
 
-void func_80A3E090(EnGm* this) {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80A3E090: derives the collider, talk and focus positions by transforming three fixed forward offsets by the actor's rotation, so all three sit out in front of him.
+void EnGm_UpdatePositions(EnGm* this) {
     Vec3f vec1;
     Vec3f vec2;
 
@@ -345,5 +346,5 @@ void EnGm_Draw(Actor* thisx, PlayState* play) {
 
     CLOSE_DISPS(play->state.gfxCtx);
 
-    func_80A3E090(this);
+    EnGm_UpdatePositions(this);  // was func_80A3E090 [LLM:HIGH]
 }
